## What it does

A live dashboard for revenue, engagement and growth, with automated alerts pushed
to Telegram and Discord.

## Approach

Data is collected and processed on a schedule, surfaced in real time, and pushed
out as alerts so the team sees changes without pulling reports by hand.

## Stack

Python on AWS, with Telegram and Discord bots handling delivery.
